ther proteins. Regulator of cellular lifespan by maintaining the repression of CDKN2A, but not by inducing telomerase activity."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}